<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><A NAME="a_002"></A>COMMONLY USED DEFINED
TERMS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 6.5pt 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.5in; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;505(b)(2) Application&rdquo; refers to an application for which one or more of the investigations relied upon by the applicant for approval &ldquo;were not conducted by or for the applicant and for which the applicant has not obtained a right of reference or use from the person by or for whom the investigations were conducted&rdquo; (21 U.S.C. 355(b)(2)).</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;A*STAR&rdquo; refers to Agency for Science, Technology and Research</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Acticule&rdquo; refers to Acticule Life Sciences Limited, an 80% owned subsidiary of Aptorum Group.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Aeneas Group&rdquo; refers to Aeneas Limited and its subsidiaries. Aeneas Limited is 76.8% owned by Jurchen Investment Corporation. Because Mr. Huen, a director holds 100% equity interest in Jurchen Investment Corporation, we refer Aeneas Group as a fellow subsidiary of Aptorum Group.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;AGP&rdquo; refers to A.G.P./Alliance Global Partners, the placement agent for the February 2020 Offering (as defined below).&nbsp;&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;AML&rdquo; refers to Aptorum Medical Limited, a 91% owned subsidiary of Aptorum Group, as of the date of this report.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;AML Clinic&rdquo; refers to an outpatient medical clinic operated by AML under the name of Talem Medical.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Aptorum Group&rdquo; and &ldquo;Group&rdquo; refer to Aptorum Group Limited, all of its subsidiaries, and VIEs to which we are a primary beneficiary.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Aptorum Non-Therapeutics Group&rdquo; refers to the Company&rsquo;s non-therapeutics segment that encompasses: diagnostics projects including the novel molecular-based rapid pathogen identification and detection diagnostics (&ldquo;RPIDD&rdquo;) technology, natural supplement products including NativusWell<SUP>&reg;</SUP>, and the AML Clinic.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Aptorum Therapeutics Group&rdquo; refers to the Company&rsquo;s therapeutics segment that is operated through its wholly-owned subsidiary, Aptorum Therapeutics Limited, a Cayman Islands exempted company with limited liability, whose principal place of business is in Hong Kong and its indirect subsidiary companies, whose principal places of business are in the United Kingdom, Singapore and Hong Kong.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;At The Market Offering&rdquo; or &ldquo;ATM Offering&rdquo; refers to the offering and sale of the Company&rsquo;s Class A Ordinary Shares, offered pursuant to the prospectus supplement and the accompanying prospectus to the registration statement on Form F-3 (File No. 333-235819), in which H.C. Wainwright &amp; Co., LLC (&ldquo;Wainwright&rdquo;), acted as the Company&rsquo;s sales agent in accordance with certain at the market offering agreement (the &ldquo;Sales Agreement&rdquo;), dated as of March 26, 2021, by and between the Company and Wainwright.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Bond&rdquo; refers to the $15,000,000 convertible bond the Company originally issued to Peace Range Limited in the Bond Offering, but which has since been repurchased by one of the Company&rsquo;s wholly owned subsidiaries, Aptorum Investment Holding Limited, pursuant to that certain Bond Repurchase Agreement dated April 24, 2019 between the Company, Peace Range Limited and Aptorum Investment Holding Limited, and which has matured and been redeemed on October 25, 2019.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Bond Offering&rdquo; refers to the Company&rsquo;s private offering of the Bond that closed on April 25, 2018.</TD></TR>
</TABLE>

<P STYLE="margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>



<P STYLE="margin: 0"></P>

