    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;IPO&rdquo; or &ldquo;Offering&rdquo; means the initial public offering by the Company of 761,419 Class A Ordinary Shares consummated on December 17, 2018.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
