    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">&ldquo;Series A Note Offering&rdquo; refers to the private offering of Series A Notes, pursuant to Regulation S or Regulation D, as promulgated under the Securities Act that closed on May 15, 2018.</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
